Z||000014||danny boy||10-19-2001||10:44 PM||||I have a set of Pilot resonated tips and a Catco cat on my other car(not Fiero). I got the cat from summit for 50 and the tips at advance for 20 each. I am very happy with both. I also have a Flowmaster 3"in dual 2.5" out muffler and I must say, while it sounds really good, it doesn't flow worth a crap. Don't be bummed it didn't work.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PFF_sig_5.jpg"> ||||reg||1
